Why Is Demand Increasing
Scalable Cloud Testing Infrastructure: Enterprises are moving away from static testing laboratories toward flexible cloud-native environments that can be provisioned according to project and workload requirements.
Rapid CI/CD Adoption: Continuous integration and continuous delivery practices require reproducible, version-controlled testing environments that can be created and refreshed rapidly across development pipelines.
Pay-Per-Use Economics: On-demand testing environments reduce upfront infrastructure investment while allowing organizations to align testing expenditure with actual usage.

